{\bf Main results.}
We provide upper bounds for the Blackwell threshold $\alphabw$ and for the $d$-sensitive threshold $\alphad$ for perfect-information SGs.
We also derive stronger results in the case of deterministic games (transition probabilities in $\{0,1\}$) or for stochastic games
with unichain structure.
