$$\mathfrak S_4^{\gamma_1}=\mathfrak S_4; \quad \mathfrak S_4^{\gamma_2}= \set{e, (1,2),(3,4), (12)(34)}\simeq \ZZ/2 \times \ZZ/2\quad \text{and}$$ 
