Using these values to simplify the previous equation, we find:
\begin{equation}
    \begin{aligned}
&-810 + 3932x^2 + 74622x^4 + 280152x^6 + 324992x^8 - 87168x^{10} \\
& - 2(1 + 4x^2)^{3/2} \Big(
    -405 + 4396x^2 + 41280x^4 + 76900x^6 \\
& + 1080x^3 \left[
    (5 + 30x^2 + 48x^4)\, \tilde{g}_{3,1}(x)
    + x(1 + 6x^2 + 8x^4)\, \tilde{g}_{3,1}'(x)
\right] \Big)=0,
