\end{equation}
which we can easily solve, obtaining:
\begin{equation}
    \tilde{g}_{3,1}(x)=\frac{216 + 405x^2 - 3845x^4}{2160x^5}
+ \frac{-216 - 1701x^2 + 119x^4 + 12199x^6 - 1816x^8}{2160x^5 (1 + 4x^2)^{3/2}}.
