%& = E_N + F_N t  - \a\sqrt{N} \int_0^tZ_N(s) ds\\ & ~~~~~~+  \frac{N}{2} (1-\g) \int_0^t  f\left(\frac{Y_N(s) + Z_N(s)}{\sqrt{N}} \right) ds 
